1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:30,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:16,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 5]</font>

15
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:19,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

16
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're still putting on a brave front,</font>

17
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:22,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just like you always have.</font>

18
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

19
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you knew all along.</font>

20
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've outmaneuvered me this time,</font>

21
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">using that birthmark to trick me.</font>

22
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I nearly fell for it.</font>

23
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you confirm my identity?</font>

24
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There was never any Blissful Union Pot.</font>

25
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made it up.</font>

26
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:44,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did the Princess die
in a foreign land?</font>

27
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did the rose</font>

28
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the Blissful Union Pot wither?</font>

29
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just put on that act</font>

30
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:52,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to force me</font>

31
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to admit I'm Qin Wei</font>

32
00:01:54,860 --> 00:01:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and to mock me, huh?</font>

33
00:01:58,500 --> 00:01:59,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's because you</font>

34
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">always deceive me.</font>

35
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:08,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

36
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:11,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's be honest with each other.</font>

37
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:15,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you know I'm Qin Wei,</font>

38
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why go through all the trouble</font>

39
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:17,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to bring me into your residence?</font>

40
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were always meant
to be my consort.</font>

41
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:26,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am the daughter of a Xizhao spy.</font>

42
00:02:27,580 --> 00:02:29,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the Prince of Beiyuan.</font>

43
00:02:29,900 --> 00:02:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I ever be worthy
to be your consort?</font>

44
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:34,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Imperial Physician Zhang, quickly!</font>

45
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Examine my son.</font>

46
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See if he has suffered the poison.</font>

47
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:38,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, check him at once.</font>

48
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is indeed poison.</font>

49
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The young general, like you two,</font>

50
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has also been poisoned.</font>

51
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:56,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you say?</font>

52
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will go right now</font>

53
00:02:58,180 --> 00:02:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and wipe out the entire Qin family.</font>

54
00:02:59,220 --> 00:02:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

55
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:01,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan, please calm your anger.</font>

56
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

57
00:03:01,940 --> 00:03:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me. What happened?</font>

58
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone in the Qin family</font>

59
00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:07,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a Xizhao spy.</font>

60
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:09,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They feared our military might,</font>

61
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so they poisoned your father, you,</font>

62
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and me.</font>

63
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you</font>

64
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">always believed my parents poisoned you,</font>

65
00:03:22,060 --> 00:03:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why keep me by your side?</font>

66
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you afraid</font>

67
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I'll stab you in the heart one day?</font>

68
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to drag you into my world.</font>

69
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want you to feel</font>

70
00:03:35,660 --> 00:03:36,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the kind of pain</font>

71
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've endured all these years.</font>

72
00:03:38,380 --> 00:03:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have us</font>

73
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:41,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">slowly tormenting each other.</font>

74
00:03:43,340 --> 00:03:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My days are numbered anyway.</font>

75
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every day of pleasure you give me</font>

76
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:50,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is your atonement for your family.</font>

77
00:03:54,940 --> 00:03:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A slap is too weak.</font>

78
00:03:58,540 --> 00:03:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

79
00:03:59,660 --> 00:04:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill me.</font>

80
00:04:01,420 --> 00:04:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill me, and you can escape.</font>

81
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Killing you</font>

82
00:04:10,340 --> 00:04:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would only make everything worse.</font>

83
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've long since fallen for someone else.</font>

84
00:04:15,620 --> 00:04:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop clinging to your foolish hopes.</font>

85
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is it?</font>

86
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:20,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan.</font>

87
00:04:21,260 --> 00:04:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've liked him for a long time.</font>

88
00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't lay a hand on her, did you?</font>

89
00:04:32,700 --> 00:04:34,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shouldn't I have laid a hand on her?</font>

90
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think</font>

91
00:04:37,060 --> 00:04:38,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you couldn't have touched her.</font>

92
00:04:39,020 --> 00:04:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think drugging my wine</font>

93
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would let you off the hook?</font>

94
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

95
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That stuff has no effect on me.</font>

96
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:46,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You beast, Li Congyao!</font>

97
00:04:47,020 --> 00:04:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you actually do something to her?</font>

98
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:53,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since His Majesty has already</font>

99
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:54,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">issued a marriage decree
for Jun Qinglan and me.</font>

100
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suggest you mind your boundaries.</font>

101
00:04:58,180 --> 00:04:59,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay away from her from now on.</font>

102
00:04:59,940 --> 00:05:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You!</font>

103
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

104
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put down the blade!</font>

105
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:03,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're ganging up on my brother.</font>

106
00:05:03,980 --> 00:05:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think our family
is so easily bullied?</font>

107
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:07,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

108
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on here?</font>

109
00:05:08,940 --> 00:05:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is his territory.</font>

110
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:11,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A wise man
doesn't fight against the odds.</font>

111
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:12,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

112
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:13,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan and I</font>

113
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:15,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have fought side by side for years.</font>

114
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:16,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've shared water from the same bowl</font>

115
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and slept in the same bed.</font>

116
00:05:17,900 --> 00:05:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't just tear us apart on a whim.</font>

117
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't think you can do
whatever you please</font>

118
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the imperial decree.</font>

119
00:05:21,980 --> 00:05:22,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

120
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:23,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one Qinglan loves is me.</font>

121
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:24,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not you.</font>

122
00:05:26,380 --> 00:05:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've shared water</font>

123
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the same bowl</font>

124
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and slept in the same bed?</font>

125
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

126
00:05:32,420 --> 00:05:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The intimate moments</font>

127
00:05:33,820 --> 00:05:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Chief and I shared</font>

128
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:36,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are far too many to count.</font>

129
00:05:36,660 --> 00:05:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must you tear us apart?</font>

130
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about this, then?</font>

131
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

132
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:41,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In broad daylight...</font>

133
00:05:42,180 --> 00:05:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go.</font>

134
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:44,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let Jun go, right now!</font>

135
00:05:46,020 --> 00:05:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will now do everything with her</font>

136
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you haven't done yet.</font>

137
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

138
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:50,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

139
00:05:50,540 --> 00:05:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See our guest out.</font>

140
00:05:53,380 --> 00:05:54,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go.</font>

141
00:05:56,060 --> 00:05:56,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Li Congyao.
- Let me go!</font>

142
00:05:58,860 --> 00:05:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go!</font>

143
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You useless fool!</font>

144
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:02,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A gentleman doesn't fight women.</font>

145
00:06:05,780 --> 00:06:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

146
00:06:06,980 --> 00:06:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems the rumors are true.</font>

147
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:10,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan</font>

148
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has lost his mind completely</font>

149
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because of a female coroner.</font>

150
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While he's drunk in the arms of romance,</font>

151
00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can send someone to make a move.</font>

152
00:06:19,260 --> 00:06:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

153
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is your painting coming along?</font>

154
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me have a look.</font>

155
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you satisfied?</font>

156
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:32,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excellent.</font>

157
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is awful! Someone, help!</font>

158
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:53,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's been a death!</font>

159
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

160
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]
This servant found the body.</font>

161
00:06:58,180 --> 00:06:58,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Upon investigation,</font>

162
00:06:59,180 --> 00:07:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she is a maid in our residence.</font>

163
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:02,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said that when he found her,</font>

164
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was already like this.</font>

165
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:05,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All the blood had drained from her body.</font>

166
00:07:05,980 --> 00:07:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judging by how she died,</font>

167
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think this might be aimed at me.</font>

168
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:10,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seal the residence first.</font>

169
00:07:11,900 --> 00:07:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say I'm unwell and seeing no visitors.</font>

170
00:07:14,820 --> 00:07:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not let a word of this leak out.</font>

171
00:07:17,460 --> 00:07:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You investigate this quietly.</font>

172
00:07:19,780 --> 00:07:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

173
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

174
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's turned
the whole place upside down.</font>

175
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's clearly doing this on purpose.</font>

176
00:07:34,060 --> 00:07:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think</font>

177
00:07:35,460 --> 00:07:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the entire mansion</font>

178
00:07:37,140 --> 00:07:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has become rather lively?</font>

179
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door, Prince Duan!</font>

180
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open up!</font>

181
00:07:41,660 --> 00:07:43,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me back my daughter!</font>

182
00:07:44,380 --> 00:07:45,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's quite lively.</font>

183
00:07:45,060 --> 00:07:45,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door!</font>

184
00:07:45,860 --> 00:07:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Trouble comes every few days.</font>

185
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me back my daughter!</font>

186
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:49,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

187
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall I drive her away?</font>

188
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:52,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

189
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door, Prince Duan!</font>

190
00:07:54,100 --> 00:07:55,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- It's time for me
- Open the door!</font>

191
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:56,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to meet my mother-in-law.</font>

192
00:08:05,060 --> 00:08:06,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao, why freeze me?</font>

193
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:13,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your mother is here.</font>

194
00:08:18,980 --> 00:08:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, Mrs. Jun is here.</font>

195
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun, right?</font>

196
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:24,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, have a seat.</font>

197
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your stools are too precious.</font>

198
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A coarse village woman like me</font>

199
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:31,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would only soil your floor.</font>

200
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here today</font>

201
00:08:33,180 --> 00:08:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to take my daughter away.</font>

202
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have taken Jun Qinglan
as my beloved consort.</font>

203
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her home now</font>

204
00:08:43,340 --> 00:08:44,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is here.</font>

205
00:08:51,060 --> 00:08:52,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is His Majesty's decree.</font>

206
00:08:53,460 --> 00:08:54,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To defy an imperial edict</font>

207
00:08:55,780 --> 00:08:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">means execution of the entire clan.</font>

208
00:08:57,940 --> 00:08:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

209
00:08:58,940 --> 00:08:59,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun,</font>

210
00:08:59,820 --> 00:09:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you needn't worry about that.</font>

211
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because Jun Qinglan truly cares for me.</font>

212
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

213
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

214
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You say</font>

215
00:09:14,700 --> 00:09:16,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan truly cares for you?</font>

216
00:09:16,300 --> 00:09:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her silence is as good as a yes.</font>

217
00:09:18,340 --> 00:09:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is one more thing I know.</font>

218
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun, you're from Minning Village.</font>

219
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:26,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Twenty years ago,</font>

220
00:09:26,660 --> 00:09:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you married the coroner Jun Bicheng
from the next village.</font>

221
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:29,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had a son.</font>

222
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the child was two,</font>

223
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your husband passed away.</font>

224
00:09:33,740 --> 00:09:35,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You inherited his craft</font>

225
00:09:35,820 --> 00:09:37,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and raised the child alone.</font>

226
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tragically,</font>

227
00:09:40,260 --> 00:09:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when your child turned eighteen,</font>

228
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he fell gravely ill.</font>

229
00:09:43,180 --> 00:09:43,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

230
00:09:44,180 --> 00:09:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is my only child now.</font>

231
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan,</font>

232
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your days are numbered.</font>

233
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:53,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must you drag Qinglan down?</font>

234
00:09:54,620 --> 00:09:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you.</font>

235
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:57,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please show mercy,</font>

236
00:09:57,340 --> 00:09:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and let her go.</font>

237
00:09:58,540 --> 00:10:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has her whole life ahead of her.</font>

238
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're pushing her into a pit of fire.</font>

239
00:10:04,460 --> 00:10:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

240
00:10:05,060 --> 00:10:05,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know</font>

241
00:10:05,540 --> 00:10:07,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why she chose to be a coroner?</font>

242
00:10:09,460 --> 00:10:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it.</font>

243
00:10:11,140 --> 00:10:12,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not her real mother.</font>

244
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't need to know.</font>

245
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

246
00:10:19,340 --> 00:10:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Consider this a reward
for saving her life.</font>

247
00:10:22,740 --> 00:10:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's enough to live out your days
in comfort.</font>

248
00:10:25,540 --> 00:10:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, you will cut all ties.</font>

249
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:30,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi will escort you to a new place.</font>

250
00:10:33,620 --> 00:10:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

251
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:37,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan and I have depended
on each other for five years.</font>

252
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:38,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have long regarded her</font>

253
00:10:38,380 --> 00:10:39,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as my own flesh and blood.</font>

254
00:10:40,300 --> 00:10:41,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this world,</font>

255
00:10:41,180 --> 00:10:42,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what mother</font>

256
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could bear to see her daughter
tormented like this?</font>

257
00:10:45,660 --> 00:10:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Madam.</font>

258
00:10:46,660 --> 00:10:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is showing you courtesy.</font>

259
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take the money and leave.</font>

260
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going.</font>

261
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead and kill me then.</font>

262
00:10:54,100 --> 00:10:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today,</font>

263
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even if I stake my life,</font>

264
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take her away</font>

265
00:10:59,020 --> 00:11:00,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and never let her fall</font>

266
00:11:00,060 --> 00:11:01,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the hands of a monster like you.</font>

267
00:11:05,140 --> 00:11:06,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're so determined to take her away,</font>

268
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but have you ever asked her
what she wants?</font>

269
00:11:09,820 --> 00:11:10,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

270
00:11:12,220 --> 00:11:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

271
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:13,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come with me.</font>

272
00:11:19,060 --> 00:11:19,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

273
00:11:20,860 --> 00:11:21,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come with me, please.</font>

274
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already bought Yizhuang.</font>

275
00:11:29,660 --> 00:11:31,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she goes with you,
she'll have to wander.</font>

276
00:11:32,340 --> 00:11:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you truly care for her,</font>

277
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should think about her future.</font>

278
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're wise,</font>

279
00:11:39,460 --> 00:11:40,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll make a choice</font>

280
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that benefits</font>

281
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:43,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">both you and her.</font>

282
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

283
00:11:59,620 --> 00:11:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

284
00:12:03,740 --> 00:12:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will go.</font>

285
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother!</font>

286
00:12:42,580 --> 00:12:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you speak
to my mother like that?</font>

287
00:12:44,780 --> 00:12:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What gives you the right?</font>

288
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have no home now.</font>

289
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You only have me.</font>

290
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:57,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her go.</font>

291
00:12:58,180 --> 00:12:58,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

292
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare she treat you this way?</font>

293
00:13:01,420 --> 00:13:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Escort her away.</font>

294
00:13:07,460 --> 00:13:08,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

295
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:11,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You will regret keeping me here.</font>

296
00:13:28,180 --> 00:13:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's out.</font>

297
00:13:29,660 --> 00:13:30,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun.</font>

298
00:13:30,220 --> 00:13:30,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is it?</font>

299
00:13:34,900 --> 00:13:35,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Qinglan?</font>

300
00:13:50,860 --> 00:13:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time, Mrs. Jun is truly crying.</font>

301
00:13:54,460 --> 00:13:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

302
00:13:57,060 --> 00:13:58,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan once said</font>

303
00:13:58,340 --> 00:13:58,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that in the past,</font>

304
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun's tantrums
and tears were all fake.</font>

305
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She used them to scare people.</font>

306
00:14:02,740 --> 00:14:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this time, she seems heartbroken.</font>

307
00:14:06,620 --> 00:14:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems Prince Duan</font>

308
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:10,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not so easy to deal with.</font>

309
00:14:20,940 --> 00:14:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

310
00:14:22,180 --> 00:14:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something to tell you.</font>

311
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:27,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

312
00:14:28,620 --> 00:14:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for Qin Wei's sake,</font>

313
00:14:30,660 --> 00:14:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've made the mansion</font>

314
00:14:32,140 --> 00:14:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an exact replica
of the General's Mansion.</font>

315
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:37,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five years have passed,</font>

316
00:14:38,540 --> 00:14:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you've never truly moved on.</font>

317
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And what of her?</font>

318
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:46,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has she ever forgotten
your wedding night?</font>

319
00:14:47,700 --> 00:14:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The more you hate her family,</font>

320
00:14:49,300 --> 00:14:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the more she hates your family.</font>

321
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:53,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't bear to watch</font>

322
00:14:53,300 --> 00:14:55,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you sink deeper into despair.</font>

323
00:14:56,980 --> 00:14:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silence.</font>

324
00:14:58,140 --> 00:14:58,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

325
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:00,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you kill me today,</font>

326
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:01,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must speak my mind.</font>

327
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before your mother passed away,</font>

328
00:15:03,340 --> 00:15:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she made me promise to look after you.</font>

329
00:15:06,540 --> 00:15:07,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But every time I see you</font>

330
00:15:07,540 --> 00:15:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">writhing in agony from the poison,</font>

331
00:15:10,300 --> 00:15:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the hatred in my heart
for the Qin family</font>

332
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:13,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only grows deeper.</font>

333
00:15:14,220 --> 00:15:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

334
00:15:17,940 --> 00:15:19,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei is already dead.</font>

335
00:15:22,340 --> 00:15:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only her death</font>

336
00:15:24,780 --> 00:15:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will bring this to an end.</font>

337
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:29,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

338
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:30,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness...</font>

339
00:15:30,580 --> 00:15:31,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is the master here?</font>

340
00:15:55,220 --> 00:15:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

341
00:15:56,780 --> 00:15:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi was right.</font>

342
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you believe that my family</font>

343
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">poisoned your family,</font>

344
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Qin Wei is your enemy's daughter,</font>

345
00:16:04,180 --> 00:16:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why keep me here for mutual hatred?</font>

346
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei is already dead.</font>

347
00:16:09,020 --> 00:16:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When will the bitter feud</font>

348
00:16:09,940 --> 00:16:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between us ever end?</font>

349
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei is dead.</font>

350
00:16:15,580 --> 00:16:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Jun Qinglan remains.</font>

351
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have more important things to do.</font>

352
00:16:19,420 --> 00:16:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you?</font>

353
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:21,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't care.</font>

354
00:16:22,660 --> 00:16:24,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only want you by my side.</font>

355
00:16:25,020 --> 00:16:26,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For your own selfish desires,</font>

356
00:16:27,060 --> 00:16:27,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you disregarded my wishes,</font>

357
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:29,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dragged me here by force,</font>

358
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drove away everyone close to me,</font>

359
00:16:31,500 --> 00:16:32,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and tormented and controlled me.</font>

360
00:16:33,100 --> 00:16:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You live in your own hell,</font>

361
00:16:34,220 --> 00:16:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you can't stand to see me happy.</font>

362
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:36,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are nothing but a vengeful spirit</font>

363
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dragging me into the abyss of suffering.</font>

364
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:39,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

365
00:16:39,620 --> 00:16:40,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am a vengeful spirit.</font>

366
00:16:41,620 --> 00:16:43,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as I draw breath,
I will haunt you</font>

367
00:16:44,180 --> 00:16:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the death without respite.</font>

368
00:16:47,860 --> 00:16:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will never give you what you want.</font>

369
00:17:00,450 --> 00:17:02,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

370
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

371
00:17:04,990 --> 00:17:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

372
00:17:08,910 --> 00:17:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

373
00:17:13,590 --> 00:17:16,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

374
00:17:17,580 --> 00:17:21,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

375
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:26,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

376
00:17:26,430 --> 00:17:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

377
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:38,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

378
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

379
00:17:43,290 --> 00:17:47,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

380
00:17:47,840 --> 00:17:50,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

381
00:17:51,810 --> 00:17:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

382
00:17:56,420 --> 00:18:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
